    "title": "What do you do? / What are you doing?",
    "words": [
     "What do you do?",
     "What are you doing?"
    ],
    "explanation_ar": "What are you doing? تسأل عمّا تفعله الآن، أما What do you do? فتسأل عادةً عن الوظيفة أو العادات.",
    "explanation_en": "\"What are you doing?\" asks about now. \"What do you do?\" usually asks about your job or habits.",
    "examples": [
     {
      "word": "What are you doing?",
      "sentence": "What are you doing? - I'm cooking."
     },
     {
      "word": "What do you do?",
      "sentence": "What do you do? - I'm a teacher."
     }
    ]
   },
